{"slug": "fyi-yachts-recap-soflo-boat-show-may-17-19-2024", "title": "FYI Yachts Recap: 2024 SoFlo Boat Show", "description": "The SoFlo Boat Show returned to the iconic Miami Marine Stadium from May 17 to May 19, 2024, delivering an unforgettable weekend...", "date": "2024-05-23", "category": "Blog", "image": "https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/06/Untitled-design-27.png", "html": "<p><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/FYI-Yachts-Recap-SoFlo-Boat-Show-May-17-19-2024-15.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>The SoFlo Boat Show returned to the iconic Miami Marine Stadium from May 17 to May 19, 2024, delivering an unforgettable weekend filled with marine excitement. This annual showcase featured an impressive lineup of marine vessels, equipment, watersports, and more, attracting boating enthusiasts from all over.</p><p>FYI Yachts was proud to present a spectacular display, including the highly anticipated debut of the stunning 2024 52′ OKEAN and <a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/okean-yachts-for-sale/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">57′ OKEAN models</a>. These remarkable vessels, alongside other exceptional models, drew significant attention for their innovative design and superior performance. Attendees had the unique opportunity to explore a diverse range of boats, from sleek cruisers to high-performance fishing vessels and beyond, immersing themselves in the latest trends in marine technology.</p><p>2024 was another incredible year at the <a href=\"https://sofloboatshow.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SoFlo Boat Show</a>! We want to extend our heartfelt gratitude to everyone who took the time to visit our booth this week. Your presence and enthusiasm truly made this event unforgettable.</p><p>We are extremely appreciative of the opportunity to share our passion for high-performance boating with such a fantastic audience. Your interest, questions, and feedback have inspired us to continue pushing the boundaries and innovating in this exhilarating industry.</p><p>Having OKEAN with us this year added an extra layer of excitement and prestige to the event, and we are grateful for their contribution. Additionally, we want to express our gratitude to Nelson Albareda and Tony Albelo for allowing us to be part of such a remarkable event. The collaboration and support from everyone involved made this show a resounding success.</p><p>We must also mention the incredible participation of Alan Blanco from Center Consoles Only, who was in charge of the entire lineup and made this event a unique market exposure opportunity.</p><p>We look forward to seeing you again at the next SoFlo Boat Show!</p><p>Check out the photos from this year’s event!</p><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/FYI-Yachts-Recap-SoFlo-Boat-Show-May-17-19-2024-18.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/FYI-Yachts-Recap-SoFlo-Boat-Show-May-17-19-2024-18-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/FYI-Yachts-Recap-SoFlo-Boat-Show-May-17-19-2024-24.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/FYI-Yachts-Recap-SoFlo-Boat-Show-May-17-19-2024-24-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/FYI-Yachts-Recap-SoFlo-Boat-Show-May-17-19-2024-27.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/FYI-Yachts-Recap-SoFlo-Boat-Show-May-17-19-2024-27-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/FYI-Yachts-Recap-SoFlo-Boat-Show-May-17-19-2024-7.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2024/05/FYI-Yachts-Recap-SoFlo-Boat-Show-May-17-19-2024-7-150x